    {
      "id": 229876,
      "name": "QuirkyDM",
      "username": "QuirkyDM",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/quirkydm/{size}/2033_2.png",
      "created_at": "2020-03-03T17:35:41.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Hey Spudone, welcome to the forums!</p>\n<p>If your game was anything like mine, Wraith would not have been eligible for Smoke Bombs shenanigans because Luminary's devices counted as the lowest hp hero target. It wasn't until Wraith got to 5 hp or less that she could take advantage of Smoke Bombs. Then you have to be careful of the environment finishing her off since Smoke Bombs only affects villain damage.</p>",
